@startuml forms-vol05-flow
title Sample flow - an emergency call (volume 5)
autonumber

actor Caller as C
participant "Dispatch\nstation" as DISP
participant "Ambulance\ncrew" as CREW
participant "Hospital\n(vol 1)" as H

C -> DISP : emergency call
DISP -> DISP : 142 call registration, 143 call card
DISP -> CREW : crew dispatched (145 substation work log)
CREW -> CREW : 144 observation sheet (on-scene care)
alt transport to hospital
  CREW -> H : handover -> 001 admission (vol 1)
end
alt air ambulance / disaster
  DISP -> DISP : 146 emergency situations, 149 air-ambulance calls,\n150 consultant physician sheet
end

note over DISP, CREW
  Call card (143) and observation sheet (144) are clinical
  (Encounter + Observation). The dispatch logs are queries.
end note
@enduml
